"""
1️⃣ =Get All Books

Endpoint:

GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/books/

Example request:

GET /api/v1/books/

Response:

[
  {
    "uid": "123",
    "title": "Python",
    "author": "Guido"
  }
]
2️⃣ Get Single Book

Endpoint:

GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/books/{book_uid}

Example:

http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/books/123
3️⃣ Create Book

Endpoint:

POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/books/

Body example:

{
  "title": "Deep Learning",
  "author": "Ian Goodfellow",
  "publisher": "MIT",
  "page_count": 800
}
4️⃣ Delete Book

Endpoint:

DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/books/{book_uid}

Example:

DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/books/123
5️⃣ Update Book (PATCH)

Endpoint:

PATCH http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/books/{book_uid}

Example:

PATCH http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/books/123

Body:

{
  "title": "Updated Book"
}
"""